></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player receives an email from eyewitnesses, gathers the necessary investigation tools, and heads to the location, where they must explore the area, meticulously collect evidence, take photographs and video recordings, and make voice notes on a recorder. Afterward, they compile the collected materials and create an investigation report.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630290/extras/0b54bd3b9b516008c98ccc47eef5fc90.poster.avif?t=1772122784\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630290/extras/0b54bd3b9b516008c98ccc47eef5fc90.webm?t=1772122784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630290/extras/0b54bd3b9b516008c98ccc47eef5fc90.mp4?t=1772122784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630290/extras/50d2888c05a937d725231a7d33fa1a7f.poster.avif?t=1772122784\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630290/extras/50d2888c05a937d725231a7d33fa1a7f.webm?t=1772122784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630290/extras/50d2888c05a937d725231a7d33fa1a7f.mp4?t=1772122784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["REFINERY66"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps